    "headline": "Flood Watch issued November 7 at 11:34AM CST until November 9 at 9:00AM CST by NWS Brownsville TX",
    "description": "Multiple rounds of locally heavy rainfall are expected between\nSaturday night and early Monday morning across the Rio Grande Plains\nand Brush Country.  The first round is most likely between midnight\nand mid-morning Sunday, when 1 to 2 inches with locally 3 or more\ninches of rain may fall. The second round is expected Sunday night\ninto early Monday morning, when an additional 1 to 3 inches with\nlo",
